-foreign-investor-access-official/articleshow/135998128.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:29:26 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fund managers turn overweight on India, first such classification since Jan]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Fund managers have recently indicated an increased interest in investing in India after several months of cautious sentiment. A significant number of investors are concerned about the absence of artificial intelligence-related investment options available. Increased interest in healthcare and shifts toward defensive sectors have been noted, reflecting changing priorities among investors. Despite concerns over potential risks, half of the fund managers predict a soft landing for the global economy.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fund-managers-turn-overweight-on-india-first-such-classification-since-jan/articleshow/135996610.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135996610,imgsize-55112.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fund-managers-turn-overweight-on-india-first-such-classification-since-jan/articleshow/135996610.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:32:14 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Investors vs Economists: Should Govt Cut LTCG Tax?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/investors-vs-economists-should-govt-cut-ltcg-tax/videoshow/135993683.cms</link><enclosure type="video/wmv" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135993683,imgsize-317751.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/investors-vs-economists-should-govt-cut-ltcg-tax/videoshow/135993683.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:01:48 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[NSE among 5 stocks hitting 52-week highs; stock rallies up to 27% in a month]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Five BSE 200 sto